    <data key="d1">venue_comparison</data>
    <data key="d2">Directed multigraph of venue preference comparisons. Each edge is one pairwise comparison by a survey respondent. Non-tie: one edge (preferred→other, weight=1.0). Tie: two edges A→B and B→A (weight=0.5 each). Missing node/edge attributes are absent (not filled with sentinels).</data>
